# Frontend build-time configuration. Copy to `.env` for local `npm run dev`.
#
# Vite inlines every VITE_-prefixed variable into the bundle that ships to the
# browser, so NOTHING SECRET GOES HERE — no JWT secret, no database URL, no
# admin key (frontend/AGENTS.md, Gotchas).

# The API Gateway (ai/decisions.md D-010): the one URL the browser should need.
# Port 8080 is provisional (D-018).
#
# LEAVE THIS EMPTY until api-gateway serves the auth routes. Empty means the
# app runs its fixture auth; setting it switches to the real flow, which will
# fail against a gateway that cannot answer yet.
VITE_GATEWAY_BASE_URL=

# TRANSITIONAL — remove once the gateway forwards. supplier-service is reached
# directly today because api-gateway/internal/proxy is still an empty scaffold.
VITE_SUPPLIER_BASE_URL=http://localhost:8082
